    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Painting of a pond with green lily pads, pink water lilies, and shimmering blue-violet water, signed lower right.",
      "long": "A square-format oil painting showing a close-up view of a pond surface. Green lily pads of varying sizes float across the frame, interspersed with small pink and white water lily blossoms. The water itself is depicted with thick, textured brushstrokes in shades of turquoise, deep blue, lavender, and muted green, suggesting light reflecting off ripples. No land, sky, or horizon is visible—only the water and its flora. A cursive signature in reddish-brown pigment appears in the lower right corner, accompanied by a four-digit year ending in '26'.",
